# Line endings are LF in the repository and on every checkout, so rustfmt
# (newline_style = "Unix"), the source checks, and the receipt fingerprint see
# identical bytes on Windows, macOS, and Linux. Without this a Windows checkout
# converts text to CRLF and `cargo fmt --check` rejects every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary test vectors and trust anchors: never line-ending normalized.
*.der binary
